<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 597.29, down 0.14.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 278 to 238.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,307,415 compared with 22,273,740 on Thursday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
